      }
    },
    {
      "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@179316",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PORTER.\nYou’ll leave your noise anon, ye rascals. Do you take the court for Parish Garden? Ye rude slaves, leave your gaping.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@179316/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@179316/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 125,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2840681,
        "end": 2840837,
        "line": 103255,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap15/p@179316",
        "anchor": "sceneV_15.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "PORTER.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@179476",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ONE.\n[Within.] Good master porter, I belong to th’ larder.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 12
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@179476/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 4,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@179476/line-2",
          "start": 5,
          "end": 58,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2840841,
        "end": 2840936,
        "line": 103261,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap15/p@179476",
        "anchor": "sceneV_15.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "ONE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@179575",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PORTER.\nBelong to th’ gallows, and be hanged, ye rogue! Is this a place to roar in? Fetch me a dozen crab-tree staves, and strong ones. These are but switches to ’em. I’ll scratch your heads. You must be seeing christenings? Do you look for ale and cakes here, you rude rascals?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@179575/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@179575/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 278,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2840940,
        "end": 2841251,
        "line": 103266,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap15/p@179575",
        "anchor": "sceneV_15.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "PORTER.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@179890",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PORTER’S MAN.\nPray, sir, be patient. ’Tis as much impossible—\nUnless we sweep ’em from the door with cannons—\nTo scatter ’em as ’tis to make ’em sleep\nOn May-day morning, which will never be.\nWe may as well push against Paul’s as stir ’em.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@179890/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 13,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@179890/line-2",
          "start": 14,
          "end": 61,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@179890/line-3",
          "start": 62,
          "end": 109,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@179890/line-4",
          "start": 110,
          "end": 150,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@179890/line-5",
          "start": 151,
          "end": 191,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@179890/line-6",
          "start": 192,
          "end": 239,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2841255,
        "end": 2841544,
        "line": 103274,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap15/p@179890",
        "anchor": "sceneV_15.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "PORTER’S MAN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 13
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@180183",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PORTER.\nHow got they in, and be hanged?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@180183/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@180183/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 39,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2841548,
        "end": 2841617,
        "line": 103283,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap15/p@180183",
        "anchor": "sceneV_15.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "PORTER.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@180256",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PORTER’S MAN.\nAlas, I know not. How gets the tide in?\nAs much as one sound cudgel of four foot—\nYou see the poor remainder—could distribute,\nI made no spare, sir.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@180256/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 13,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@180256/line-2",
          "start": 14,
          "end": 53,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@180256/line-3",
          "start": 54,
          "end": 95,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@180256/line-4",
          "start": 96,
          "end": 140,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@180256/line-5",
          "start": 141,
          "end": 162,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2841621,
        "end": 2841828,
        "line": 103288,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap15/p@180256",
        "anchor": "sceneV_15.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "PORTER’S MAN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 13
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@180467",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PORTER.\nYou did nothing, sir.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@180467/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@180467/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 29,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2841832,
        "end": 2841891,
        "line": 103296,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap15/p@180467",
        "anchor": "sceneV_15.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "PORTER.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@180530",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PORTER’S MAN.\nI am not Samson, nor Sir Guy, nor Colbrand,\nTo mow ’em down before me; but if I spared any\nThat had a head to hit, either young or old,\nHe or she, cuckold or cuckold-maker,\nLet me ne’er hope to see a chine again—\nAnd that I would not for a cow, God save her!",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@180530/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 13,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@180530/line-2",
          "start": 14,
          "end": 57,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@180530/line-3",
          "start": 58,
          "end": 104,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@180530/line-4",
          "start": 105,
          "end": 149,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@180530/line-5",
          "start": 150,
          "end": 186,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@180530/line-6",
          "start": 187,
          "end": 226,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@180530/line-7",
          "start": 227,
          "end": 272,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2841895,
        "end": 2842222,
        "line": 103301,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap15/p@180530",
        "anchor": "sceneV_15.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "PORTER’S MAN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 13
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@180861",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ONE.\n[Within.] Do you hear, master porter?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 12
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@180861/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 4,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@180861/line-2",
          "start": 5,
          "end": 42,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2842226,
        "end": 2842305,
        "line": 103311,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap15/p@180861",
        "anchor": "sceneV_15.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "ONE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@180944",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PORTER.\nI shall be with you presently, good master puppy.—\nKeep the door close, sirrah.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@180944/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@180944/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 58,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@180944/line-3",
          "start": 59,
          "end": 87,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2842309,
        "end": 2842431,
        "line": 103316,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap15/p@180944",
        "anchor": "sceneV_15.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "PORTER.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@181070",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PORTER’S MAN.\nWhat would you have me do?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@181070/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 13,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@181070/line-2",
          "start": 14,
          "end": 40,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2842435,
        "end": 2842505,
        "line": 103322,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap15/p@181070",
        "anchor": "sceneV_15.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "PORTER’S MAN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 13
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@181144",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PORTER.\nWhat should you do, but knock ’em down by th’ dozens? Is this Moorfields to muster in? Or have we some strange Indian with the great tool come to court, the women so besiege us? Bless me, what a fry of fornication is at door! On my Christian conscience, this one christening will beget a thousand; here will be father, godfather, and all together.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@181144/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@181144/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 355,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2842509,
        "end": 2842898,
        "line": 103327,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap15/p@181144",
        "anchor": "sceneV_15.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "PORTER.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@181537",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PORTER’S MAN.\nThe spoons will be the bigger, sir. There is a fellow somewhat near the door—he should be a brazier by his face, for, o’ my conscience, twenty of the dog-days now reign in’s nose. All that stand about him are under the line; they need no other penance. That fire-drake did I hit three times on the head, and three times was his nose discharged against me. He stands there, like a mortar-piece, to blow us. There was a haberdasher’s wife of small wit near him that railed upon me till her pinked porringer fell off her head for kindling such a combustion in the state. I missed the meteor once and hit that woman, who cried out “Clubs!” when I might see from far some forty truncheoners draw to her succour, which were the hope o’ th’ Strand, where she was quartered. They fell on; I made good my place; at length they came to th’ broomstaff to me; I defied ’em still, when suddenly a file of boys behind ’em, loose shot, delivered such a shower of pebbles that I was fain to draw mine honour in and let ’em win the work. The devil was amongst ’em, I think, surely.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@181537/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 13,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@181537/line-2",
          "start": 14,
          "end": 1078,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2842902,
        "end": 2844023,
        "line": 103336,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap15/p@181537",
        "anchor": "sceneV_15.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "PORTER’S MAN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 13
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@182662",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PORTER.\nThese are the youths that thunder at a playhouse and fight for bitten apples, that no audience but the tribulation of Tower Hill or the limbs of Limehouse, their dear brothers, are able to endure. I have some of ’em in Limbo Patrum, and there they are like to dance these three days, besides the running banquet of two beadles that is to come.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 227,
          "end": 239
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "king-henry-the-eighth/sceneV_15.3/p@182662/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
